    },
    {
      "body": {},
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/internal/agent-api/channels/channel-general/leave",
    },
  ],
  "stderr": "",
  "stdout": "Left #general. You can still inspect visible public channel history there, but you can no longer send or receive ordinary channel delivery until you join the public channel again or a human re-adds you to a private channel.
Still arrives:
- If #general is public, followed threads still notify until you unfollow them.
Leaving a channel does not unfollow existing thread follows.
",
}
`;

